---
const steps = [
  "Pick what's going on",
  "Check the official Ontario government page",
  "Get care, or register with a doctor who can see you",
];
---
<section class="medical-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> › <a href="/get-started">Get Started</a> › Medical care
      </nav>
      <h1>Medical care in Ontario</h1>
      <p class="lead">You don't need to understand the healthcare system to get the care you need.</p>
      <p class="body">Pick what's going on, and we'll point you to the right kind of care, and the official programs that cover it.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#situations" class="primary-btn">Find my option</a>
        <span class="checked">Last checked October 2026, Ontario</span>
      </div>
      <p class="emergency-note">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3L2 20h20L12 3z" /><path d="M12 9v5M12 17h.01" /></svg>
        If this is a medical emergency, call <strong>911</strong> or go to your nearest emergency room.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="how-card">
      <h2>How this works</h2>
      <ol>
        {steps.map((step, i) => (
          <li><span class="step-num">{i + 1}</span>{step}</li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .medical-hero { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 32px 24px 72px; }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px; gap: 64px; align-items: start;
  }
  .breadcrumb { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: inherit; }
  h1 { font-size: 52px; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .lead { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .body { font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.75; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .primary-btn {
    background: var(--teal); color: white; text-decoration: none;
    padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .primary-btn:hover { background: #17636F; }
  .checked { font-size: 14px; color: var(--green); }

  .emergency-note {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    max-width: 600px; margin: 0; padding: 14px 18px;
    background: rgba(15, 36, 56, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--navy);
  }
  .emergency-note svg { flex: none; opacity: 0.8; }

  .how-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-top: 44px; }
  .how-card h2 { font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .how-card ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .how-card li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; font-size: 15px; }
  .step-num {
    flex: none; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(27, 122, 136, 0.12); color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .how-card { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 { font-size: 38px; }
  }
</style>
